/Pg 32 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
878 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (Build the new content engine the moment demo bikes land. MK1 footage carried the brand to 1,600 signups, but the MK2 is the production product, and backers and press need to see the bike in motion. Refresh Meta creative within 48 hours of first MK2 footage.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
879 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 389 0 R
/T (Direction: The next 3-4 months consist of closing capital, demo bike delivery, and Kickstarter execution in one sequence. All other initiatives are put on the backburner until successful kickstarter. )
/E (Direction: The next 3-4 months consist of closing capital, demo bike delivery, and Kickstarter execution in one sequence. All other initiatives are put on the backburner until successful kickstarter. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
880 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (The validation process surfaced an audience we never would have written into the original strategy. Field test rides pointed toward the lapsed motorcyclist and e-bike upgrader, but Meta data revealed a third segment, the RV adventurer, that ended up being our top-performing audience and represents net-new TAM rather than a slice of existing demand. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
881 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (The same ad can perform dramatically differently across audiences. Ad creative we assumed would underperform did well when paired with the right audience. The same creative flatlined against the wrong segment. Audience targeting is the real lever, not the ad itself. The hypothesheet framework forced us to test combinations rather than draw conclusions from a single variable. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
882 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (Personal connection beats polish. The messaging that worked best was descriptive of the product, and felt like a friend sharing content rather than advertising slop or AI-generated feed. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
